        ttl Subroutines PAG*****************************************************************     TxEnblA         Enable Transmit Interrupt to Async *****************************************************************TXENBLA LDB  XSTATA     CHECK TO SEE IF INTERRUPT ALREADY ON.        BMI  TXENBLA1   BRANCH IF SO.        LDB  #$01       SET INTERRUPT FLAG TO FIRST INTERRUPT.        STB  XSTATA     STORE NEW FLAG VALUETXENBLA1 LDB  COMREG     LOAD USART COMMAND RETUSTER        ANDB #$F3       STRIP OFF UNUSED BITS.        ORB  #$04       SET UART TO TRANSMIT.        STB  COMREG        RTS             RETURN*****************************************************************     RxRsetU         Break Sync & Reset USART Receiver  *** **************************************************************RXRSETU LDA  #$0F       BREAK SYNC, RESET RECIEVER.        STA  CONTU      STORE IN USART CONTROL REGISTER.        LDA  #$26       ENABLE RECIEVER AND RECIEVER INTERRUPT.        STA  CONTU      STORE IN USART CONTROL REGISTER.        RTS             RETURN*****************************************************************     RxStrpU         Set USART Receiver NOT Strip Syncs *****************************************************************RXSTRPU LDA  #$22       SET USART TO NOT STRIP SYNCS.        STA  CONTU      STORE IN USART CONTROL REGISTER.        RTS             RETURN                        *****************************************************************     TxRsetU          Reset USART Transmitter           *****************************************************************TXRSETU LDA  #$0F       RESET USART TRANSMITER        STA  CONTU      STORE IN PART.        RTS             RETRUN*****************************************************************     TxErrEnU         Set USART Rcv Error Interrupt     *****************************************************************TXERRENU LDD  #$490C    SET ERROR INTERRUPT ENABLE.           STD  CONTU      STORE IN USART.        LDD  #$09EC        STD  CONTU      RESET TRANSMIT INTERRUPT ENABLE.        RTS             RETURN PAG ********************************************************   R T S H I G H   RTSHIGH SWITCHING ROUTINE   ******************************************************** RTSHIGH LDA LATCH.HL    LOAD CURRENT LATCH SETTINGS.RTSH00  ANDA #$FE        SET DCD HIGH FOR TRANSMITION OF TEXT TO HOST.        STA LATCH.HL    SAVE LATCH SETTINGS IN RAM.        STA LATCH       SET HARDWARE LATCH. RTSH5U  LDD #$0B6C      RESET POINTERS.        STD CONTU       POINT TO TRANSMIT REGISTER.        LDD #$4B0C      RESET ALL SORTS OF STUFF.        STD CONTU       STORE IN USART.        LDA  #$04       LOAD NUMBER OF SYNC CHARACTERS        STA  SYNC.CNT   STORE FOR INTERRUPT TO HANDLE.        LDD  #$CBFF     PRELOAD SYNC CHARACTER.        STD  CONTU      STORE IN USART.RTSH7U  LDA  #$01       SET TRANSMIT STATE ON INTERRUPT.        STA  XMT.MODE   STORE IN INDICATOR.        LDA #$D9        ENABLE USART TO TRANSMIT.        STA CONTU       STORE CHARACTER IN PART.        RTS**********************************************************************     RTSLOW          DROP RTS SIGNALS AND RESET TRANSMITER   **********************************************************************RTSLOW  LDA  LATCH.HL   LOAD CURRENT LATCH SETTINGS.        ORA  #$01       DROP ALL RTS SIGNALS TO SYNC SIDE.        STA  LATCH.HL   SAVE CURRENT LATCH SETTINGS.        STA  LATCH      STORE IN HARDWARE LATCH.                   LDD  #$0B6C     DISABLE XMIT,RECIEVE,CLR SYNC.        STD  CONTU      STORE IN USART.        CLR  FIQT.PAS   CLEAR PASS INDICATOR.        RTS             RETURN. PAG**************************************     INITIALIZE FREE LIST   ***************************************INTFREE LDX  #BUF_SPC    LOAD BEGINNING OF BUFFER SPACE.        STX  Free.Node   STORE IN FREE NODE.        LDD  #BUF_SPC    LOAD FIRST NODE.        CLRBINTFRE1 INCA            POINT TO NEXT NODE        STA  ,X         STORE SUCCESSOR NODE.        BHS  INTFRE2    BRANCH IF SO.        TFR  D,X        POINT TO NEXT LOCATION        BRA  INTFRE1    GO DO NEXT NODE.INTFRE2 LDA  #$00       STORE `NULL' SUCCESSOR NODE AT END OF LIST.        STA  ,X         STORE IN NODE.        LDA  #MAX_NODE   LOAD NUMBER OF NODES YOU JUST INITIALIZED.        STA  Free.cnt   STORE AS FREE NODE COUNT.        RTS             RETURN.******************************************          INITIALIZE QUEUES      ******************************************INITQUE LDX  Free.Node  GET NODE FROM FREE LIST.        LDA  ,X         LOAD SUCCESSOR NODE.                 CLRB            MAKE SURE B IS CLEAR.        STX  SiQue.wr   STORE QUEUE POINTERS        STX  SiQue.rd        STB  SiQue.ct   SET COUNT TO 00        STB  SiQue.sm   RESET SEMAPHORE BIT ON QUEUE.                              TFR  D,X        POINT TO NEXT NODE ON LIST.        LDA  ,X         LOAD SUCCESSOR NODE.                 STX  SoQue.wr   STORE QUEUE POINTERS        STX  SoQue.rd        STB  SoQue.ct   SET COUNT TO 00        STB  SoQue.sm   RESET SEMAPHORE BIT ON QUEUE.        TFR  D,X        POINT TO NEXT NODE ON LIST.        LDA  ,X         LOAD SUCCESSOR NODE.                 STX  OtQue.wr   STORE QUEUE POINTERS        STX  OtQue.rd        STB  OtQue.ct   SET COUNT TO 00        STB  OtQue.sm   RESET SEMAPHORE BIT ON QUEUE.        TFR  D,X        POINT TO NEXT NODE ON LIST.        LDA  ,X         LOAD SUCCESSOR NODE.                 STX  InQue.wr   STORE QUEUE POINTERS        STX  InQue.rd        STB  InQue.ct   SET COUNT TO 00        STB  InQue.sm   RESET SEMAPHORE BIT ON QUEUE.        STD  Free.Node  STORE POINTER BACK ON FREE LIST        LDB  Free.cnt   LOAD COUNT OF NODES ON FREE LIST.        STB  Free.cnt   STORE NEW COUNT.        RTS             RETURN.              ********************************************************     INCQUEUE        INCREMENT QUEUE POINTERS  **********************************************************            x = pointer to Queue Control BlockINCQUEUE LDD  Write,X    LOAD QUEUE ENTRY POINTER.        ADDD #Que_Entry  POINT TO NEXT ENTRY.        STD   Write,X    STORE QUEUE ENTRY POINTER.        INC  QueCnt,X  INCREMENT QUEUE ENTRY COUNT.        RTS              RETURN              ********************************************************     DECQUEUE        DECREMENT QUEUE POINTERS  **********************************************************            x = pointer to Queue Control BlockDECQUEUE LDD  Read,X    LOAD QUEUE ENTRY POINTER.        ADDD #Que_Entry  POINT TO NEXT ENTRY.        STD   Read,X    STORE QUEUE ENTRY POINTER.        DEC  QueCnt,X  DECREMENT QUEUE ENTRY COUNT.        RTS              RETURN PAG  QUEBUF LDU #OtQue.wr LOAD ADDRESS OF QUEUE POINTERS. JSR QUEMSG PUT MESSAGE ON OUTPUT QUEUE. LDB InQue.rd+1 INCREMENT INPUT QUEUE READ POINTER. ADDB #Que_Entry STB InQue.rd+1 STORE NEW QUEUE POINTER. DEC InQue.ct DECREMENT NUMBER OF QUEUED ITEMS. RTS  RETURN (USUALLY BACK TO TOP OF TXA)************************************************************     QUEMSG          PUT BUFFER ON OUTPUT QUEUE.   ***QUEMSG LDY Write,U LOAD OUTPUT QUEUE WRITE POINTER.*                       MOVE BUFFER POINTERS ONTO QUEUE. LDD ,X  STD ,Y (Write pointer) LDD 2,X  STD 2,Y (Read pointer) LDA 4,X  STA 4,Y (Count of nodes) LDB Write.pnt,U INCREMENT WRITE POINTER. ADDB #Que_Entry STB Write.pnt,U STORE NEW QUEUE POINTER. INC QueCnt,U INCREMENT COUNT OF QUEUED ELEMENTS. RTS  RETURN.  PAG  REQUE TST Sem,U CHECK QUEUE WRITE SEMAPHORE FLAG BEQ REQUE1 BRANCH IF OK TO WRITE. SWI2    BRA REQUE ELSE WAIT FOR FLAG TO CLEAR.REQUE1 INC Sem,U SET SEMAPHORE FLAG. LDY Write,U LOAD QUEUE WRITE POINTER. LDX Read,U LOAD QUEUE READ POINTER.*            MOVE QUEUE ENTRY FROM READ TO WRITE.  (8 bytes to move) LDD ,X  STD ,Y  LDD 2,X  STD 2,Y  LDD 4,X  LDD 6,X  STD 6,Y  LDB Write.pnt,U INC WRITE POINTER. (MSB of pointer constant) ADDB #Que_Entry STB Write.pnt,U STORE NEW QUEUE POINTER. LDB Read.pnt,U INC READ POINTER. (MSB of pointer constant) ADDB #Que_Entry STB Read.pnt,U STORE NEW QUEUE POINTER. CLR Sem,U RESET SEMAPHORE FLAG. RTS  RETURN.  PAGALOCATE PSHS CC DISABLE INTERRUPTS FOR NOW. ORCC #$50  LDD Free.Node LOAD FREE NODE POINTER (NOTE: lsb = 00) BEQ ALOC010 BRANCH IF ERROR (NO SPACE ON FREE LIST) STD Write,U SAVE NODE POINTERS FOR THIS NODE STD Read,U  CLR Write.pnt,U  LDB [Write,U] load successor pointer STB Free.Node store in free node pointer. INC Node.cnt,U set number of nodes for this buffer. LDA #$01 POINT TO FIRST DATA ELEMENT IN NODE. STA Write.pnt,U  STA Read.pnt,U  PULS CC RE ENABLE INTERRUPTS LDX Write,U SET CC <> 0 FOR GOOD RETURN. RTS  RETURN ALOC010 PULS CC  CLRB  SET CONDITION CODE = 0 FOR ERROR. RTS  RETURN. (NO MORE SPACE!) PAG  DEALOC PSHS CC  ORCC #$50  CLR Write.pnt,U SET POINTER TO SUCCESSOR OF WRITE NODE. LDB Read,U load beginning of buffer LDX Free.Node load free list pointer STB Free.Node  STX [Write,U] STORE AS SUCCESSOR OF WRITE NODE. LDA Node.cnt,U LOAD BUFFER ELEMENT COUNTER. ADDA Free.cnt ADD TO COUNT OF FREE NODES. STA Free.cnt STORE AS NEW FREE COUNT. CLR Node.cnt,U reset node count of Buffer Control Block. PULS CC  RTS  RETURN.  PAG  **************************************     PUT BUFFER              ***TRPUTBUF CMPA #$17 CHECK FOR [ETB] BHI PUTBUF IF NORMAL CHARACTER DONT MAKE TRANSPARENT BEQ TRPTBF1  CMPA #$10 CHECK FOR [DLE] BEQ TRPTBF1  CMPA #$03 CHECK FOR [SOH] [STX] or [ETX] BHI PUTBUF ELSE MUST BE NORMAL CONTROL CHARACTER CMPA #$00  BEQ PUTBUF DON'T MAKE NUL's TRANSPARENT.TRPTBF1 PSHS A SAVE CHARACTER ON STACK. LDA #$10 PUT [DLE] INTO BUFFER. BSR PUTBUF  PULS A RESTORE CHARACTER.PUTBUF STA [Write,U] STORE CHARACTER IN BUFFER INC Write.pnt,U INCREMENT WRITE POINTER. BNE PUTBUF1 BRANCH IF NOT AT END OF NODE. LDB Free.Node LOAD FREE NODE POINTER BEQ PUTBUF2 BRANCH IF NONE LEFT.     (ERROR) STB [Write,U] STORE SUCESSOR POINTER ON LAST NODE. STB Write,U STORE NEXT NODE POINTER. LDB [Write,U] LOAD SUCESSOR OF NEXT NODE. STB Free.Node STORE AS NEXT FREE NODE POINTER. DEC Free.cnt DECREMENT COUNT OF FREE NODES. INC Node.cnt,U INCREMENT BUFFER NODE COUNT. INC Write.pnt,U STORE VALUE. RTS  RETURN. CC <> 0   GOOD RETURN.PUTBUF1 LDB #$01 SET CC <> 0 GOOD RETURN RTS  RETURN *            ERROR EXIT.PUTBUF2 DEC Write.pnt,U RESET WRITE POINTER TO WHAT  IT WAS AT START. CLRB  SET CONDITION CODE = 0 FOR ERROR. (NO MORE SPACE!)QPUTBUF STA [Write,U] STORE CHARACTER IN BUFFER INC Write.pnt,U INCREMENT WRITE POINTER. RTS RETURN.GETBUF  PSHS B        LDA  [Mid,U]    LOAD CHARACTER FROM BUFFER.        INC  Mid.pnt,U  INCREMENT BUFFER POINTER.        BNE  GETBUF10   BRANCH IF NODE WRAP.        LDB  [Mid,U]    LOAD SUCCESSOR POINTER.        BMI  GETBUF20   BRANCH IF NOT VALID SUCESSOR (TERMINATE)        STB  Mid,U     STORE AS NEXT READ NODE.        INC  Mid.pnt,U  INCREMENT OFF SUCCESSOR POINTER.GETBUF10 PULS B,PC       RETURN.GETBUF20 CLRB           SET CONDITION CODE TO ERROR.         PULS B,PC      RETURN.␀␀